# google-services.json and android/debug.keystore are COMMITTED on purpose so a
# collaborator can clone, build and sign in immediately: this repo must stay
# PRIVATE. The Firebase key is a client identifier, not a secret — access is
# enforced by firestore.rules / Supabase RLS, and the API key should be
# restricted (package name + SHA-1) in Google Cloud console. Never make this
# repo public without purging these from history first.

